# Evidence Vault doctrine · per docs/EVIDENCE_VAULT_OBJECT_STORAGE_DOCTRINE.md
# + docs/AGENT_GRADE_RECEIPT_SCHEMA.md
#
# AgentGrade bundles contain PRIVATE_EVIDENCE + DERIVED_DATASETS
# artifacts that MUST NOT be committed to a public repo. Only the
# PUBLIC_ASSETS subset (agent_identity · model_manifest ·
# compute_manifest · runtime_environment · tool_permissions ·
# benchmark_pack_manifest · failure_taxonomy · safety_harness_results
# · grades_card · public_safe_attestation · manifest.sha256 · the
# issued deed JSON) may be tracked.

# Exclude PRIVATE_EVIDENCE files
**/prompt_policy_private.md
**/dataset_provenance.json
**/raw_outputs/

# Exclude DERIVED_DATASETS files (contain rule-check detail, not for public)
**/tribunal_scores.jsonl
**/performance_metrics.csv
**/cost_energy_metrics.csv
# Refund-batch convention adds per-task / per-case detail jsonl · same
# privacy class as tribunal_scores.jsonl above.
**/task_results.jsonl
**/adversarial_results.jsonl

# Explicit allowlist · compute-inspector convention
!**/agent_identity.json
!**/model_manifest.json
!**/compute_manifest.json
!**/runtime_environment.json
!**/prompt_policy.md
!**/tool_permissions.json
!**/benchmark_pack_manifest.json
!**/failure_taxonomy.json
!**/safety_harness_results.json
!**/grades_card.json
!**/public_safe_attestation.json
!**/manifest.sha256
!**/ddeed-*.json
# Refund-batch public-safe subset (founder-spec files minus the two
# per-task / per-case jsonls above):
!**/run_manifest.json
!**/tribunal_candidate_verdict.json
!**/hard_fail_summary.json
!**/sha256sums.txt
!.gitignore
!README.md
